*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0049
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-05-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 527
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0049.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CRD0049C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CREDIT-CUTOFF
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    STOP RUN.
CREDIT-CUTOFF.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 760 AND DTI-RATIO LESS THAN 0.40
            MOVE 'A' TO CREDIT-DECN
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 620
            MOVE 'R' TO CREDIT-DECN
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'D' TO CREDIT-DECN
    END-EVALUATE.
